Add a skill reference to toolbox.yaml.

Usage
  azd ai toolbox add skill <name>[@<version>] [flags]

Flags
      --file string : Path to the local toolbox definition. (default "toolbox.yaml")

Global Flags
  -C, --cwd string              : Sets the current working directory
      --debug                   : Enables debug and diagnostics logging
  -e, --environment string      : The name of the environment to use
  -h, --help                    : help for skill
      --no-prompt               : Runs without prompts. Uses existing values; fails if any required value or decision cannot be resolved automatically.
  -o, --output string           : The output format (supported: table, json) (default "table")
      --project-endpoint string : Foundry project endpoint URL for remote operations only (not local add or extension version).

Examples
  Add a versioned skill reference to the local definition
    azd ai toolbox add skill my-skill@2 --file ./toolbox.yaml
